	(text "Pins 12, 15 to 16, 21 to 23, 25 to 31, 33, 35, 36, 39, 40 and 49 (host bus, MII, digital I/O) are unused in SPI mode and left open."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 250.19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1ddb7484-0821-5ed7-a976-be9fe9b8e6e1")
	)
	(text "TESTMODE to ground (required). FXLOSEN, FXSDENA and FXSDENB to ground = copper twisted pair. REG_EN to 3.3 V = internal 1.2 V regulators. OSCO open (single-ended oscillator on OSCI)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 246.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "405fe994-b4a7-5a20-b5fe-ce77b0cade16")
	)
	(text "RUNLED / E2PSIZE: 10 k pull-up = EEPROM size strap high (32 Kbit and up, 2-byte addressing). The pin is open drain, so the RUN LED is +3V3 > 1 k > LED > pin."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 238.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "45336824-ed79-5dad-af40-d170f526e498")
	)
	(text "Design notes"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 233.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4546ca4d-8ea7-5a06-9e6c-3baafc6bdf0c")
	)
	(text "The ESI EEPROM must hold PDI = SPI before the first run. WP is low so the master can write it (the EVB ties WP high)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 261.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "55b6c9fa-49d3-56a8-b1c5-168cf157e2ef")
	)
	(text "Each twisted-pair line has 49.9 R to its port's filtered 3.3 V; the magnetics centre taps (TXCT and RXCT together) are on the same net with 22 nF. RBIAS 12.1 k 1 % to ground. VDDCR: 1 uF + 470 pF at pin 6, 100 nF at pins 24 and 38."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 257.81 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6114051e-f20b-519c-a4eb-40a3db9cfd18")
	)
	(text "EtherCAT ERR LED, red: driven by STM32 pin PD3 (the LAN9252 has no ERR output)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 31.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6e143514-2b9b-5f0d-a076-667c26c0827a")
	)
	(text "LINKACTLED0 / CHIP_MODE0 and LINKACTLED1 / CHIP_MODE1: 10 k pull-downs = chip mode 00 (2 ports) and active-high LED outputs; 1 k to the green LED in each jack."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 242.57 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "881c6687-cbad-5d69-8afc-008a4ebd43fc")
	)
	(text "4  ETHERCAT  -  LAN9252 (SPI), ESI EEPROM, two RJ45 jacks with magnetics, RUN and ERR LEDs"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 10.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "90bcc609-25b6-5fd4-854c-7278f3aa30e6")
	)
	(text "As in the EVB-LAN9252-SPI reference: VDD33TXRX1, VDD33TXRX2 and VDD33BIAS each come from +3V3 through a 220 R ferrite bead with 100 nF; VDD12TX1/2 come from VDDCR through a ferrite bead with 2 x 100 nF."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 254 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "928b0ddb-b242-50cf-bc0d-ef65c4911a2c")
	)
	(text "Chip mode 00 = 2 ports (PHY A = port 0 = J401, PHY B = port 1 = J402). The PDI is chosen by the ESI EEPROM content (SPI slave). Rows and values follow the LAN9252 datasheet DS00001909A (sections 3, 4, 7, 12.10 and 14)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 16.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9d114408-8117-57fa-a8e9-c0cbde355387")
	)
